      4 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَبْسَأْتُهُ</span></b>  <i>I made him sociable, friendly,</i> or
<i>familiar;</i> or <i>cheered him,</i> or <i>gladdened him, by
my company</i> or <i>converse,</i> or <i>by my presence.</i>
(S, K.)


